{
  "title": "Generate website export types and validation from the schema",
  "description": "Game export v9 is represented independently by \
game-export-v9.schema.json, the large Python parser/type module, \
website/src/types/game-export.d.ts, normalize-game-export.ts, and an \
additional validator in load-games.ts. The website declarations and validators \
are manually maintained, while normalizeGameExport performs only shallow array \
checks before casting unknown data to GameExportV9. Establish the JSON Schema \
as the source of truth for generated TypeScript declarations and runtime \
validation, or otherwise reduce the representations to one authoritative \
validator per language. Ensure loadFullGame and loadAllGames use the same \
validation guarantees. Add a regeneration/check command and CI test that fails \
on generated drift. Do not weaken current fail-fast validation or add \
compatibility fallbacks for malformed exports.",
